>> title: Tahini Sauce
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: tahini, garlic, lemon, middle eastern, no-cook
>> counters: Shawarma Counter, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: tahina, tahini, tarator, taratour, tahini dressing
>> pairs-with: pita-bread, mujaddara
>> servings: 8
>> time: 10 min

>> step: mash to a paste
Mash @garlic{1%clove} with @kosher salt{1/2%tsp} to a paste.

>> step: whisk in until it seizes
Whisk @tahini{1/2%cup}(120 g; well stirred) and @lemon juice{3%Tbs}(45 mL) into @&(~1)garlic paste{} until the mixture seizes and stiffens.

>> step: whisk in a spoonful at a time
Whisk @ice water{1/3%cup}(80 mL) into @&(~1)paste{} a spoonful at a time until it turns pale and pours like cream.

>> step: season
Season @&(~1)sauce{} with @ground cumin{1/4%tsp} and @flat-leaf parsley{2%Tbs}(chopped).
